            ('What is MCP server development?', 'MCP server development is building servers that implement the Model Context Protocol, an open standard that lets AI models and agents call tools and read data from external systems in a consistent way. Each server exposes a system, such as your CRM or ERP, as a set of described tools and resources. Any MCP-compatible client, including assistants and custom agents, can then use those tools without its own custom integration, subject to the authentication and permissions you define.'),
